  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening Citizen Participation in Ward Governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to strengthen public participation in one ward per sub-county of Turkana County in order to increase transparency, strengthen democracy and inculcate a culture of good governance and participation. It shall involve engagement of traditional public participation mechanisms, capacity building of women/ youth as well as village/ ward administrators, develop communication material, engage the county assembly and increase organisational/ institutional capacity,</narrative>
  </description>
